one-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1935748e7ae3e7f43c78fc4b3d97558a66a41fda", "message": "improvement", "created_at": "2025-08-13T14:26:46Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5d32866215b0f696e9a8249e39c05e4e214acaff", "message": "new notify-update function ready\n\nthe goal is to keep the sendemail updated, also if is used outside the multi report. Setting a simple cronjob to run once a week, using the --notify_update args, will notify the user if an update is available", "created_at": "2025-08-13T13:30:57Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ac0391f1173c9b3d7f923488c9725809d78642b6", "message": "new --notify_update arg\n\nallow stand-alone user to create a cronjob to check if update are available. a Weekly cron is more than enough considering that the script recevie 1-2 update for month", "created_at": "2025-08-13T10:15:55Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "be53f0e1e200c8811a90b3e2a384efed022d78db", "message": "preparing docs for next version", "created_at": "2025-08-13T07:51:02Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d892e3246603c9b7438bfba52a1cd120ee2392b2", "message": "enhanced test email design", "created_at": "2025-08-13T07:41:30Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2b72b461d37620bc1613d1d347e3283a9a755938", "message": "new version in progress\n\nlittle typo corrected", "created_at": "2025-08-13T07:01:26Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a9456d459640d4d1f9615034fb33360cb7a34b22", "message": "Update README.md\n\ndocumentaion update reflecting --test_mode", "created_at": "2025-08-06T08:57:25Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eda56cd75033c22b371e22fb92fb15a8e320f291", "message": "Update multireport_sendemail.py\n\n- test mode released", "created_at": "2025-08-05T12:39:37Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b5b022ff806b55236b538cee9759bf5376ac1b87", "message": "improved testmode\n\nauto retrieve recipient address from the context user", "created_at": "2025-08-05T12:20:45Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2452b5cdc0b7099442714553a951b2ebd1e4a456", "message": "add pre-release file for 1.25", "created_at": "2025-07-31T09:34:42Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9d0901797833fc8ad2e9ce38345bfbccc8c2d41d", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2025-07-21T10:07:36Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4ee11a20d57bfb1d64ddc9f58a959ba3ceba6fa5", "message": "restored Core compatibility, security improvement\n\n- the script  will try to define if is used on a Core or Scale system to adjust accordingly the midclt path\n- add a max of 50mb size for attachment\n- attachment that are symlink are not allowed anymore\n- add a check to prevent CRLF injection on certain args\n- add a blacklist of attachment that are not allowed to be send", "created_at": "2025-07-20T17:48:35Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6dcca87217976d4f4e550cba0baf1093f96a88ac", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2025-06-28T16:36:22Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39bd415db40cc7bc4f6095615e0a0eb3b56911e8", "message": "Update README.md\n\ncorrected typo", "created_at": "2025-06-28T15:51:39Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3ac23fac944fadd14674663666cef44f10d040b6", "message": "issue #11\n\nenhanced the error handle in SMTP path: to avoid the sendemail return \"ko\" when connection is closed abnormally/without a status code not handled by smtplib (after the email is send) with providers like QQ mail, some error codes are now verified and suppressed gracefully", "created_at": "2025-06-27T12:32:16Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4e3d8f5aeb067856b0a3bd7e93d6b12a26529719", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2025-05-20T13:34:09Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0c4feda29acf3b26772959d43c431105b6c7a448", "message": "issue #9\n\nnow the script will correctly assign the correct value for `smtp_senderemail` nor in bulk email and Outlook path", "created_at": "2025-05-10T06:07:59Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b416c9a6b1e7227233f8e4b85fe54a0b32f61818", "message": "Delete .deepsource.toml", "created_at": "2025-04-16T13:23:09Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "263d7e950eef6a6bba47b5e51a5fc3a0e6533f7c", "message": "Update multireport_sendemail.py", "created_at": "2025-04-06T09:59:09Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "597b9e426fae75e19020ba34edfb5883815dcde3", "message": "new sender override logic", "created_at": "2025-04-06T09:55:32Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1f72e87b14c5ea1f608c204aa4ecdfe0f2bbc1cb", "message": "fix on attachments count", "created_at": "2025-03-31T06:44:56Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fdc272fae6f136d108f2b0d9200648e8f1a9edfd", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2025-03-28T16:33:00Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a499789c7960ac581cf2b1b474cafe2e96ea31cf", "message": "minor improvement\n\n- add the capability to send email to more than 1 recipient in `bulk_email` path too\n- using sys.exit instead of exit to let a caller intercept better errors\n- removed: the script not clean up logs file anymore\n- removed: permission will not set anymore > not working in Fangthoot", "created_at": "2025-03-28T16:24:59Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "72ed83851ee4b953bca3846af2e3b7bb6460ba29", "message": "outlook integration\n\n- now the script will use the Outlook access token (available from Fangtooth version)\n- disabled the default debugging", "created_at": "2025-03-24T15:59:43Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c9ba402b9ccfa2e54b387fb7ccc7f9b42e36ec0d", "message": "Update README.md\n\nFOR 25.04 RC1 USER: The new Outlook oauth IS NOT YET supported", "created_at": "2025-03-21T09:36:17Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4a9770af8954b464a6ef81ba1e11b66097fbced4", "message": "switch sendmail from smtp_user to smtp_fromemail\n\nimprove compatibility with providers. Ensure that your \"from email\" value in TN is a valid and accepted addresso on your server provider", "created_at": "2025-03-01T10:18:06Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5013be35dd545da5d4c670738586c9517f1eb25c", "message": "Update multireport_sendemail.py\n\nnow smtp \"route\" parse correctly more than 1 recipient if more addresses are passed as comma separated values", "created_at": "2025-02-12T13:47:11Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "09e5aa9389fde40ea9ac9b0c0c150c710ec38b69", "message": "bugfix\n\nadd the capability to send email when smpt login is not necessary", "created_at": "2025-01-30T13:20:33Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4888d76ae7a1c5601b1f3fb62fb826cba6d37eff", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of https://github.com/oxyde1989/standalone-tn-send-email", "created_at": "2025-01-28T06:39:13Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9c88a78eb0fad3ef0388c660910feab9cdb76921", "message": "CIFS/NFS Compatibility\n\nThe script now will not raise an error if apply permission fail due to restricted mode or if placed into a CIFS/NFS dataset", "created_at": "2025-01-28T06:39:11Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "aefc45aadc05ebcdbfebd072dd9a3d5dba86130a", "message": "Merge pull request #7 from krin-san/feature/chmod\n\nMake shebang useful adding executable bit", "created_at": "2025-01-26T20:19:13Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "20686b0fe9582b19933abbbe38dc508e23a933e1", "message": "security improved", "created_at": "2025-01-26T11:34:40Z", "repo": "standalone-tn-send-email", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "71d094b24bc90d036520a697ae355a2c8740d5f0", "message": "bug fix + minor improvement\n\nmail-bulk smtp flow neede